# note: MSKCC Lilac, gpuqueue: one GPU on any available host, no card
#       constraint, 8 slots, 12 hours. Queues sooner than asking for an A100,
#       at the cost of landing on whatever card is free; use
#       Lilac_A100_1GPU_4h when the run needs an A100 specifically.
--scheduler
lsf
--queue
gpuqueue
--cores
8
--gpu
1
--walltime
12h
